      "comment": "COBBLE HILL (4) has a terrific record this trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Recorded a 5 length win (29.76) in a Grade 5 last time at Sandown. Looks a key chance on best form. YALE TURN (1) jumped quickly from box three to score (25.77) two back then drew the same last time but settled off pace and could manage only a 14 length 6th at The Meadows (31.12). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Worth following up. KISS FOR CASH (5) was drawn the middle last start but pinged the lids and recorded an all-the-way win (30.33) at The Meadows in a Restricted WIN over 525m. Will go close again if runs up to latest. PURE SILK (7) cannot be left out over a shorter distance.",
